{
  "text": [
    "Let a continuous-time system be given by \u1e8b (t) = Ax (t) + Bu (t) y (t) = Cx (t)  where A \u2208 R p\u00d7p , B \u2208 R p\u00d7q , C \u2208 R r\u00d7p and x, u, y are the state, the input and the measurement, respectively.",
    "We assume that (A, B) and A T , C T are controllable (see  for a new reduction from the case where (A, B) and A T , C T are only stabilizable).",
    "Let"
  ],
